// M5-A3P-1014. Ch21 H03 the release (C, 1.5 min). GOODBYE: KESH. She lifts and DOESN'T LOOK AT HIM.
// The camera stays on SEFIR'S FACE, which doesn't move, while her light rises out of the top of frame; we never cut to
// her. `release_sting`, the Ch20 sting, last and longest. The lamp-key (the keepsake) goes last, out of frame above him.
title: ch21_kesh_release
location: ch21/heart
---
@letterbox on
@camera HT09
@music release_sting fade=0.0
@vfx glimmer_lift at=kesh count=60 motion=spiral_up rate=slow
@wait 8.0
@vfx glimmer_lift at=lamp_key count=1 motion=spiral_up rate=slow
@wait 4.0
@letterbox off
===
